WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.100
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.120 --> 00:02.540
[Disclaimer: Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions,

3
00:02.560 --> 00:05.020
and events shown in the series are entirely fictional,

4
00:05.040 --> 00:07.500
solely for the purpose of entertainment, with no intention to instruct

5
00:07.520 --> 00:10.000
or promote any kind of behavior; viewer discretion is advised]

6
00:10.660 --> 00:11.680
Can you call me that again?

7
00:12.000 --> 00:13.600
You called me "Soul."

8
00:14.960 --> 00:16.240
You took really nice pictures.

9
00:16.320 --> 00:17.920
You're even prettier in person than in the photo.

10
00:19.520 --> 00:20.680
So, I think...

11
00:21.160 --> 00:23.560
I actually might really like you, Mim.

12
00:25.560 --> 00:27.400
You look after me, take care of me, pay attention to me...

13
00:27.560 --> 00:29.040
That's what you'd call flirting.

14
00:29.780 --> 00:31.160
So, can I?

15
00:32.740 --> 00:34.040
Lately,

16
00:34.280 --> 00:35.760
you're the only one in my life.

17
00:46.520 --> 00:47.520
Oh, Mom?

18
00:47.780 --> 00:48.960
Soul, dear.

19
00:50.660 --> 00:54.540
I'm going to a meditation retreat with Phing in Saraburi for three days.

20
00:54.560 --> 00:57.040
What, Mom? Why so suddenly?

21
00:57.900 --> 00:59.380
Well, we were just talking

22
00:59.400 --> 01:01.520
and decided just like that.

23
01:01.800 --> 01:02.640
Wow...

24
01:03.640 --> 01:05.180
Are you gonna be okay on your own?

25
01:06.240 --> 01:07.740
Of course I am, Mom.

26
01:07.760 --> 01:09.200
I'm all grown up now.

27
01:09.220 --> 01:10.800
You don't have to worry about me.

28
01:12.480 --> 01:13.660
I know you say that,

29
01:13.680 --> 01:15.600
but I still worry.

30
01:16.160 --> 01:17.280
But...

31
01:17.520 --> 01:19.640
I'm just as stubborn as you. I love sneaking out, too.

32
01:20.900 --> 01:23.800
Anyway, don't forget to eat all your meals,

33
01:24.120 --> 01:26.040
and don't stay up too late, dear.

34
01:27.440 --> 01:29.040
Understood, Mom.

35
01:29.760 --> 01:30.640
Oh,

36
01:31.120 --> 01:32.600
if you're free,

37
01:32.620 --> 01:33.980
don't forget to visit Xinxin, too.

38
01:34.000 --> 01:35.480
Go keep her company.

39
01:35.800 --> 01:37.600
Phing is also worried about her,

40
01:37.880 --> 01:39.400
and I'm worried about you.

41
01:40.040 --> 01:43.160
If you two stay together, then we can both stop worrying.

42
01:46.600 --> 01:49.120
I haven't talked to her in a week, Mom.

43
01:49.600 --> 01:51.200
She's probably busy

44
01:51.220 --> 01:53.200
and doesn't have time to see anyone.

45
01:55.480 --> 01:57.000
Are you two fighting or anything?

46
01:58.400 --> 02:00.200
We're probably not.

47
02:00.220 --> 02:02.360
We were talking just fine before this.

48
02:05.160 --> 02:06.420
Or maybe...

49
02:08.320 --> 02:10.040
Judging by what she said,

50
02:10.400 --> 02:12.340
she was definitely hitting on you, girl.

51
02:12.360 --> 02:14.600
If I were you, I wouldn't even question it anymore.

52
02:15.100 --> 02:16.900
Her words, her actions,

53
02:16.920 --> 02:18.200
anyone can see she's hitting on you.

54
02:18.840 --> 02:20.820
Well, I mean, you can't help but wonder, right?

55
02:20.840 --> 02:22.140
If I assume she's hitting on me,

56
02:22.160 --> 02:23.880
she'll just think I'm full of myself.

57
02:25.800 --> 02:28.880
Is my sweet little Xinxin finally falling in love?

58
02:29.200 --> 02:32.120
- Lada! - I'm gonna cry.

59
02:32.360 --> 02:33.760
I'm being serious!

60
02:34.240 --> 02:35.000
Alright, listen.

61
02:35.680 --> 02:37.020
If she likes you,

62
02:37.040 --> 02:37.880
you'll know it.

63
02:38.400 --> 02:39.880
But if she doesn't,

64
02:39.900 --> 02:41.000
you'll be confused.

65
02:42.400 --> 02:43.680
So sharp, so on point.

66
02:43.860 --> 02:45.140
How did you even think of that, girl?

67
02:45.160 --> 02:45.980
I picked it up somewhere.

68
02:46.000 --> 02:47.020
Gosh!

69
02:47.040 --> 02:48.520
I almost had a heart attack.

70
02:50.120 --> 02:51.720
You could ask the whole world,

71
02:51.940 --> 02:53.240
but no one would know better

72
02:53.260 --> 02:54.840
than you

73
02:54.860 --> 02:56.500
and your Miss Architect.

74
02:56.520 --> 02:57.560
Alright, sweetie?

75
02:58.160 --> 03:00.360
She isn't my Miss Architect.

76
03:01.440 --> 03:03.440
So many words, but they all mean

77
03:03.460 --> 03:05.280
"my Miss Architect."

78
03:05.840 --> 03:07.620
You only focused on that word, huh?

79
03:07.640 --> 03:09.120
Nothing else in your life matters anymore?

80
03:09.220 --> 03:10.400
Gosh...

81
03:11.160 --> 03:13.680
Can you two take this more seriously?

82
03:13.940 --> 03:15.680
Who isn't being serious here?

83
03:15.980 --> 03:16.680
- You, sis. - You, sis.

84
03:19.800 --> 03:20.720
Gosh!

85
03:20.900 --> 03:23.400
Well, from what Lada said,

86
03:23.840 --> 03:25.280
I have just one question.

87
03:25.760 --> 03:27.180
Do you even know

88
03:27.200 --> 03:28.920
that she likes you?

89
03:31.220 --> 03:32.680
Well, I know,

90
03:33.120 --> 03:34.900
but I'm just not sure

91
03:34.920 --> 03:36.180
if she was

92
03:36.200 --> 03:37.720
actually... hitting on me

93
03:37.740 --> 03:39.560
or just being friendly...

94
03:41.840 --> 03:43.840
But you're the closest person to her.

95
03:44.240 --> 03:46.780
You're the one who would

96
03:46.800 --> 03:48.000
pick it up.

97
03:48.280 --> 03:50.260
But from what you've told us,

98
03:50.280 --> 03:51.240
I think...

99
03:52.080 --> 03:53.800
you really mean a lot to her.

100
03:54.040 --> 03:55.560
If you weren't that important,

101
03:55.580 --> 03:57.140
she wouldn't leave her meeting...

102
03:57.160 --> 03:58.360
just to see you. Am I right?

103
03:58.520 --> 04:00.140
True. I agree with her on this.

104
04:00.160 --> 04:03.120
And you have to ask yourself

105
04:03.140 --> 04:05.300
why you didn't call Nan or me that day,

106
04:05.320 --> 04:07.680
but chose to call her first.

107
04:08.760 --> 04:10.740
This is so obvious. Super obvious.

108
04:11.420 --> 04:13.080
It's because

109
04:13.540 --> 04:16.600
she's your top priority right now, isn't she?

110
04:17.040 --> 04:17.680
Hm?

111
04:20.000 --> 04:22.660
Well...from what we've discussed,

112
04:22.680 --> 04:25.240
if you still don't have the answer,

113
04:25.620 --> 04:27.580
I think you should take some time apart.

114
04:27.600 --> 04:29.560
No meeting up, no talking at all.

115
04:29.840 --> 04:30.940
And if you still

116
04:30.960 --> 04:32.800
miss her,

117
04:33.200 --> 04:34.440
that means

118
04:34.800 --> 04:37.420
you already like her, Xinxin.

119
04:43.600 --> 04:45.400
It's alright.

120
04:47.040 --> 04:48.560
It's gonna be okay.

121
06:28.640 --> 06:29.600
Soul.

122
06:31.320 --> 06:32.760
Are you alright?

123
06:33.000 --> 06:35.040
You've been playing with your food for like half an hour now.

124
06:35.580 --> 06:37.080
Yeah, he's right.

125
06:37.100 --> 06:38.060
It's nothing.

126
06:38.080 --> 06:39.560
I don't feel like eating.

127
06:42.740 --> 06:44.000
And what's the matter?

128
06:44.400 --> 06:46.040
You're wearing the unlucky color again.

129
06:54.660 --> 06:56.320
What does lioness mean?

130
06:57.800 --> 06:58.560
- Huh? - Huh?!

131
06:59.300 --> 07:01.140
What does lioness mean?

132
07:01.160 --> 07:02.640
Well, someone told me that...

133
07:02.940 --> 07:04.520
I'm a lioness.

134
07:04.800 --> 07:06.280
Lioness.

135
07:08.760 --> 07:09.760
I see.

136
07:11.880 --> 07:13.320
Let me guess.

137
07:13.980 --> 07:15.260
Is it something like

138
07:15.280 --> 07:16.600
a lady-killer?

139
07:17.660 --> 07:18.720
But "lady-killer"

140
07:18.960 --> 07:20.720
is used to describe guys who play around.

141
07:21.040 --> 07:23.040
If they called you that,

142
07:23.520 --> 07:25.500
you're a woman who plays around.

143
07:25.520 --> 07:26.320
What?

144
07:26.340 --> 07:27.400
- Really? - Mm.

145
07:27.420 --> 07:28.480
Do I look like one?

146
07:30.880 --> 07:31.880
You don't.

147
07:32.320 --> 07:33.840
Because if you were one,

148
07:33.860 --> 07:35.420
you'd already have someone, right?

149
07:35.440 --> 07:36.060
Yeah.

150
07:36.080 --> 07:37.860
Ever since I've known you,

151
07:37.880 --> 07:40.080
I haven't heard about anyone at all.

152
07:40.200 --> 07:41.700
Yeah, she's right.

153
07:41.720 --> 07:43.040
You can believe her.

154
07:43.240 --> 07:44.720
Someone like Mim, you know...

155
07:44.960 --> 07:46.280
She's always attentive

156
07:46.500 --> 07:48.000
and likes to know what's going on.

157
07:48.020 --> 07:50.060
So, if there's anything she doesn't know,

158
07:50.080 --> 07:51.200
it doesn't exist.

159
07:51.880 --> 07:52.560
Hey.

160
07:52.720 --> 07:54.480
- Oyl. - What?

161
07:57.060 --> 07:57.960
Hold on.

162
07:58.280 --> 08:01.320
If someone said you're like...a lady-killer,

163
08:01.580 --> 08:02.920
that means...

164
08:03.400 --> 08:05.380
your flirting skills

165
08:05.400 --> 08:06.840
are quite something, huh?

166
08:08.600 --> 08:09.760
That's also true.

167
08:10.440 --> 08:11.380
See?

168
08:11.400 --> 08:12.960
Who says only tigers hide their claws?

169
08:12.980 --> 08:13.860
- Here! - Mm.

170
08:13.880 --> 08:15.000
"A lioness hides her claws."

171
08:16.480 --> 08:17.400
Gosh...

172
08:17.640 --> 08:19.660
I'm just following my feelings, you know?

173
08:19.680 --> 08:21.280
You don't really need any skills for that.

174
08:23.240 --> 08:24.140
And...

175
08:24.160 --> 08:26.160
why do you...

176
08:26.800 --> 08:27.960
look so down

177
08:28.320 --> 08:29.680
like this?

178
08:29.760 --> 08:30.960
They don't like you?

179
08:32.080 --> 08:34.440
I don't even know if she liked me.

180
08:34.700 --> 08:36.400
She just totally ghosted me.

181
08:42.560 --> 08:43.580
I don't wanna think about it anymore.

182
08:43.600 --> 08:44.760
My head's killing me.

183
08:45.140 --> 08:45.900
- Whoa. - What?

184
08:45.920 --> 08:47.120
Wait, Soul.

185
08:47.840 --> 08:48.640
What's wrong with her?

186
08:49.240 --> 08:51.460
She hasn't even eaten yet, and now she's gone.

187
08:51.480 --> 08:52.720
Honestly, sis,

188
08:53.240 --> 08:54.780
what a waste of shrimp.

189
08:54.800 --> 08:56.040
Yeah. Then why didn't you...

190
08:56.600 --> 08:57.780
eat it?

191
08:57.800 --> 08:59.020
- You're right. - Hey, hey!

192
08:59.040 --> 09:00.040
Oh, my bad.

193
09:22.000 --> 09:23.760
Hello, Madam Waen.

194
09:27.940 --> 09:29.720
You couldn't reach her at all?

195
09:32.560 --> 09:34.880
Well...I'll go look for her, then.

196
09:35.680 --> 09:36.880
Alright.

197
09:37.480 --> 09:38.720
Goodbye.

198
09:47.520 --> 09:50.200
Oh, it's not that bad. I'm fine.

199
09:50.280 --> 09:52.020
- Nope. - How are you getting back, though?

200
09:52.040 --> 09:53.240
Want to take my car?

201
09:53.680 --> 09:55.480
No worries, someone's gonna pick me up.

202
10:09.200 --> 10:10.500
Who's that, Soul?

203
10:18.800 --> 10:19.560
Xinxin!

204
10:21.880 --> 10:22.920
Lada!

205
10:23.720 --> 10:24.760
How did you get here?

206
10:25.080 --> 10:25.900
And...

207
10:26.080 --> 10:27.280
how did you get here?

208
10:32.320 --> 10:33.260
So, Ms. Xinxin was

209
10:33.280 --> 10:35.000
the feng shui master who worked with you.

210
10:35.520 --> 10:36.820
And she's also your friend?

211
10:38.440 --> 10:40.760
So Soul is your architect?

212
10:41.720 --> 10:44.220
She isn't my architect.

213
10:47.100 --> 10:49.540
So, Ms. Xinxin was the one

214
10:49.880 --> 10:51.440
who called you a lady-killer, right?

215
10:52.400 --> 10:53.040
What?

216
10:53.600 --> 10:55.420
Have you been gossiping about me?

217
10:55.440 --> 10:57.680
Hey, don't worry about me right now.

218
10:58.000 --> 11:00.360
Let's talk about these two.

219
11:00.480 --> 11:01.280
What's the deal?

220
11:01.600 --> 11:04.000
She was still your client just last month, wasn't she?

221
11:04.400 --> 11:05.080
Hey...

222
11:05.360 --> 11:06.220
Hey...

223
11:07.640 --> 11:08.520
What's the deal?

224
11:08.880 --> 11:10.160
Spill.

225
11:10.960 --> 11:12.200
Uh...

226
11:12.340 --> 11:13.840
I'll tell you about it later.

227
11:14.680 --> 11:17.100
Yeah, right, right.

228
11:17.120 --> 11:18.820
Aren't you feeling under the weather?

229
11:18.840 --> 11:19.880
You'd better go get some rest.

230
11:20.120 --> 11:21.840
Well, I need to get back to work.

231
11:22.280 --> 11:23.680
I have to go now, Ms. Xinxin.

232
11:25.040 --> 11:26.040
Uh...

233
11:26.400 --> 11:28.060
Goodbye, Soul.

234
11:28.080 --> 11:28.920
I gotta go.

235
11:42.000 --> 11:42.880
So...

236
11:43.340 --> 11:45.080
are you feeling that bad?

237
11:46.120 --> 11:47.960
I just have a slight fever.

238
11:48.400 --> 11:50.220
But don't tell my mom about it.

239
11:50.240 --> 11:53.160
I bet she'll rush out of the temple if she finds out.

240
12:13.200 --> 12:14.080
Whoa...

241
12:14.520 --> 12:15.800
you made this yourself?

242
12:16.680 --> 12:17.440
Nope.

243
12:17.780 --> 12:19.040
I ordered it.

244
12:20.560 --> 12:21.560
I knew it.

245
12:21.620 --> 12:22.760
I doubt

246
12:22.780 --> 12:24.640
you'd go to the trouble of cooking for me.

247
12:25.420 --> 12:26.820
Just eat it already,

248
12:26.840 --> 12:28.560
so you can take your meds and get some sleep.

249
12:29.160 --> 12:31.600
How can I sleep when my work isn't done yet?

250
12:32.320 --> 12:34.080
A little rest won't hurt.

251
12:34.560 --> 12:36.640
You can take a break too, you know.

252
12:37.080 --> 12:39.040
We work to earn money

253
12:39.320 --> 12:40.760
for trips,

254
12:40.780 --> 12:42.960
not to spend it on medical bills like you do.

255
12:45.840 --> 12:47.340
You're nagging just like my mom.

256
12:50.920 --> 12:53.160
So, why are you here anyway?

257
12:53.400 --> 12:54.400
Did you need something?

258
12:54.840 --> 12:55.600
Oh...

259
12:56.220 --> 12:57.960
Madam Waen called me

260
12:57.980 --> 12:59.640
and said she couldn't reach you.

261
13:00.480 --> 13:02.400
Maybe she doesn't know you're sick.

262
13:04.760 --> 13:05.520
Right,

263
13:05.960 --> 13:07.560
I'll call her back.

264
13:08.100 --> 13:09.200
Sorry for

265
13:09.560 --> 13:11.080
causing you so much trouble.

266
13:13.480 --> 13:14.640
It's fine.

267
13:15.680 --> 13:17.040
We're working together anyway.

268
13:28.720 --> 13:29.480
So...

269
13:29.960 --> 13:31.240
are you heading back now?

270
13:31.480 --> 13:32.640
It's going to get late.

271
13:34.240 --> 13:35.840
Are you alright by yourself?

272
13:36.320 --> 13:38.660
Oh, it's nothing.

273
13:38.680 --> 13:40.280
I'll just take some meds and...

274
14:03.800 --> 14:04.960
Whoa...

275
14:05.360 --> 14:07.080
You're burning up.

276
14:07.520 --> 14:10.100
If you were alone, you could’ve hit your head on the floor

277
14:10.120 --> 14:11.440
and passed out in your house.

278
14:12.880 --> 14:14.140
It's not that bad.

279
14:14.160 --> 14:16.360
I'll just take some meds, and I'll be fine.

280
14:17.320 --> 14:18.580
Medicine won't help

281
14:18.600 --> 14:20.920
if you don't get some rest.

282
14:21.080 --> 14:22.520
Didn't you say

283
14:22.540 --> 14:24.320
you were taking good care of yourself?

284
14:24.480 --> 14:25.860
Going to bed early

285
14:25.880 --> 14:27.360
and not pushing yourself too hard...

286
14:28.500 --> 14:29.760
How did you get sick, then?

287
14:31.440 --> 14:32.780
There's just too much work,

288
14:32.800 --> 14:34.160
and I can't get it all done in time.

289
14:37.100 --> 14:39.080
Then why did you take on this project?

290
14:39.600 --> 14:41.580
Why didn't you just let Mr. Pat handle it?

291
14:43.520 --> 14:44.600
How did you know?

292
14:45.800 --> 14:47.560
Ms. Mim told me everything.

293
14:50.120 --> 14:51.280
When?

294
14:52.240 --> 14:54.500
Well, Soul is a bit under the weather,

295
14:54.520 --> 14:56.380
so I took her to the doctor.

296
14:56.400 --> 14:57.600
Then I dropped her off here.

297
14:58.600 --> 15:00.320
Luckily, it wasn't anything serious.

298
15:00.840 --> 15:03.120
Why did she suddenly get sick?

299
15:04.960 --> 15:07.440
Well, Soul has been working really hard lately.

300
15:07.820 --> 15:10.040
She took on Madam Waen's project for Pat.

301
15:10.520 --> 15:13.400
He's a senior architect at the company.

302
15:14.360 --> 15:16.580
Normally, the most...

303
15:16.600 --> 15:17.520
she'd take on is...

304
15:17.960 --> 15:19.640
around...three projects.

305
15:20.800 --> 15:23.100
But then Madam Waen's project came along,

306
15:23.120 --> 15:24.320
and it really threw her off.

307
15:25.800 --> 15:27.820
If she was handling this many projects,

308
15:27.840 --> 15:29.760
why didn't she let someone else handle it?

309
15:32.440 --> 15:34.840
I think it was because of you.

310
15:39.000 --> 15:40.760
I'm not trying to gossip, but...

311
15:41.220 --> 15:42.120
You are.

312
15:43.280 --> 15:45.380
This isn't "gossiping,"

313
15:45.680 --> 15:47.920
it's a "warning."

314
15:50.320 --> 15:52.600
Well, if you happened

315
15:52.760 --> 15:54.520
to work with Pat,

316
15:54.800 --> 15:57.800
I bet he'll be flirting with you nonstop.

317
15:58.440 --> 16:00.300
Even Oyl, who's an expert flirt,

318
16:00.320 --> 16:02.160
can't compete with him.

319
16:03.360 --> 16:04.360
This person

320
16:05.000 --> 16:06.640
is a total lady-killer.

321
16:07.160 --> 16:10.240
You're in for a bumpy ride if you have to work with him.

322
16:10.840 --> 16:13.300
I think Soul was worried about you,

323
16:13.320 --> 16:14.660
so she took on this project instead.

324
16:22.200 --> 16:23.600
Gosh, Mim...

325
16:24.440 --> 16:25.920
If you're struggling,

326
16:26.160 --> 16:28.720
just let Mr. Pat handle this project instead.

327
16:29.360 --> 16:31.000
Don't push yourself this much.

328
16:31.080 --> 16:32.000
No.

329
16:34.520 --> 16:36.520
I want to work with Mr. Pat.

330
16:36.800 --> 16:39.320
At least I don't have to argue with him like I do with you.

331
16:40.480 --> 16:41.740
I already took on the project,

332
16:41.760 --> 16:43.040
so I have to finish it.

333
16:43.600 --> 16:45.240
And I won't let you

334
16:45.260 --> 16:46.680
work with anyone else either.

335
16:51.360 --> 16:55.000
You're not the only architect in this world, you know.

336
16:57.040 --> 16:59.560
But the only feng shui master I want to work with

337
17:01.080 --> 17:02.320
is you, Xinxin.

338
17:21.560 --> 17:22.680
Cheers.

339
17:28.960 --> 17:31.960
I just found out that the architect Xinxin talked about

340
17:32.720 --> 17:34.320
is your senior at work.

341
17:34.900 --> 17:36.080
What a small world, huh?

342
17:37.800 --> 17:38.960
Do you think...

343
17:40.160 --> 17:41.320
your senior

344
17:42.280 --> 17:43.520
likes my friend?

345
17:48.720 --> 17:49.920
What about your friend?

346
17:50.440 --> 17:51.700
Does she like my senior?

347
18:00.960 --> 18:02.120
Well, I can't speak

348
18:03.200 --> 18:04.280
for her.

349
18:07.080 --> 18:08.480
But there's no doubt

350
18:09.920 --> 18:11.920
that I like you.

351
18:17.120 --> 18:18.640
You like me that much, huh?

352
18:20.520 --> 18:21.500
What about you?

353
18:24.560 --> 18:25.400
What?

354
18:38.040 --> 18:39.000
Do you like me?

355
18:48.920 --> 18:50.920
So much.

356
20:43.760 --> 20:44.540
Just...

357
20:44.560 --> 20:45.640
go to sleep.

358
20:46.160 --> 20:47.640
I'll be sleeping downstairs.

359
20:48.040 --> 20:49.100
What?

360
20:49.120 --> 20:50.660
You can sleep in my room.

361
20:50.680 --> 20:52.200
Why do you want to go downstairs?

362
20:52.400 --> 20:53.660
You said you'd look after me,

363
20:53.680 --> 20:55.480
so shouldn't you be keeping a close eye on me?

364
20:56.560 --> 20:58.600
Are you really sick?

365
20:59.080 --> 21:00.540
Do you wanna see the doctor's note?

366
21:00.560 --> 21:01.640
I'm just being sarcastic.

367
21:04.200 --> 21:05.960
Come on, just sleep in my room.

368
21:05.980 --> 21:07.680
I'm too weak to do anything to you.

369
21:08.760 --> 21:09.800
You pervert!

370
21:12.240 --> 21:13.160
Come on.

371
21:23.380 --> 21:26.040
You're the one who told me to go to bed early, come on.

372
21:38.440 --> 21:39.360
Do you...

373
21:39.600 --> 21:40.920
usually go to bed early?

374
21:42.220 --> 21:43.000
Well...

375
21:44.240 --> 21:46.360
I try to go to bed before midnight.

376
21:48.160 --> 21:49.140
Then...

377
21:49.160 --> 21:51.520
until Madam Waen's project is finished,

378
21:51.840 --> 21:53.360
text me

379
21:54.200 --> 21:55.880
before you go to bed, okay?

380
21:57.920 --> 22:00.800
Why do you care when I go to bed?

381
22:02.080 --> 22:04.120
So I can go to bed.

382
22:06.240 --> 22:07.320
How so?

383
22:08.560 --> 22:09.980
Well, when you text me,

384
22:10.000 --> 22:12.440
I'll know it's time.

385
22:12.720 --> 22:14.500
Sometimes I get so caught up in work

386
22:14.520 --> 22:16.280
I completely lose track of time.

387
22:18.840 --> 22:21.960
You're saying that like you'll believe what I say.

388
22:22.200 --> 22:23.400
What?

389
22:23.580 --> 22:26.400
Why don't you try it before judging?

390
22:30.000 --> 22:31.920
Let's start today, then.

391
22:32.320 --> 22:33.640
It's already past 10.

392
22:34.080 --> 22:36.000
Time to call it a night, Miss Architect.

393
22:36.400 --> 22:37.360
Aww...

394
22:37.560 --> 22:39.160
Can we make it 11?

395
22:39.200 --> 22:39.980
See?

396
22:40.000 --> 22:42.060
We haven't even started, and you're already negotiating.

397
22:42.080 --> 22:44.120
Then why should I even tell you?

398
22:45.880 --> 22:48.700
Alright, take it easy. Don't snap at me yet.

399
22:48.720 --> 22:50.120
I'm gonna sleep, alright?

400
22:51.560 --> 22:53.000
I'm not even snapping.

401
22:53.340 --> 22:55.960
I've never snapped at you.

402
22:56.400 --> 22:58.720
You were the one who snapped at me

403
22:58.800 --> 23:00.700
when we first met.

404
23:04.960 --> 23:06.100
I'm sorry

405
23:06.120 --> 23:09.520
for leaving you with a bad memory of our first meeting.

406
23:11.600 --> 23:12.920
But from now on,

407
23:14.240 --> 23:15.960
I'll make things better.

408
23:20.640 --> 23:23.520
It's too late to feel sorry now, Miss Architect.

409
23:24.040 --> 23:25.120
You were such

410
23:25.680 --> 23:27.960
a grumpy, loud lion back then.

411
23:36.320 --> 23:37.140
Wait...

412
23:37.160 --> 23:38.620
I'm going to sleep now.

413
23:39.360 --> 23:41.760
Can you turn off the lights for me?

414
23:43.040 --> 23:44.640
And...

415
23:45.400 --> 23:48.000
that love-boosting lamp you bought for me...

416
23:50.160 --> 23:51.360
Shouldn't that be turned off?

417
23:53.920 --> 23:55.240
I think...

418
23:55.880 --> 23:57.960
it's starting to work now.

419
24:14.320 --> 24:15.920
Sweet dreams, Xinxin.

420
24:47.280 --> 24:48.320
Morning.

421
24:49.140 --> 24:50.280
Morning.

422
24:53.480 --> 24:54.800
Why are you looking at me like that?

423
24:56.240 --> 24:57.120
So pretty.

424
25:06.840 --> 25:08.560
Why the puzzled look?

425
25:10.000 --> 25:11.720
How could you tell?

426
25:12.320 --> 25:15.220
Well, you've got that confused puppy look on your face.

427
25:15.240 --> 25:17.840
Hey... A dog? Really?

428
25:17.920 --> 25:19.840
What's not cute about dogs?

429
25:22.140 --> 25:23.100
You're right.

430
25:23.780 --> 25:25.220
I like dogs,

431
25:25.760 --> 25:27.640
and I like you, too.

432
25:33.580 --> 25:35.180
So, what do you want to know,

433
25:35.200 --> 25:35.920
huh?

434
25:37.120 --> 25:38.980
I'm just thinking...

435
25:39.000 --> 25:40.960
where do we go from here?

436
25:42.920 --> 25:44.480
We've come this far.

437
25:44.860 --> 25:46.200
Wasn't last night clear enough?

438
25:49.360 --> 25:50.600
It was,

439
25:50.960 --> 25:53.140
but I mean our status.

440
25:54.320 --> 25:55.600
Well...

441
25:57.040 --> 25:58.160
why don't we make it official?

442
25:59.600 --> 26:00.560
Of course.

443
26:00.900 --> 26:02.000
What are we waiting for?

444
26:02.520 --> 26:03.400
So, we're girlfriends now, huh?

445
26:03.560 --> 26:04.440
Mm.

446
26:05.240 --> 26:06.040
We are,

447
26:06.160 --> 26:07.320
babe.

448
26:10.840 --> 26:12.680
Does that mean I can do whatever I want with you?

449
26:25.040 --> 26:26.480
Can I have more, please?

450
26:27.360 --> 26:28.280
Go on.

451
26:28.560 --> 26:30.720
I'm your girlfriend, so I can do whatever I want.

452
26:35.510 --> 26:37.280
You're not allowed to leave me now.

453
26:37.300 --> 26:39.680
You got that? Huh? Huh?

454
27:09.240 --> 27:10.120
Hey.

455
27:11.480 --> 27:12.240
Hey...

456
27:16.320 --> 27:16.800
Hey.

457
27:18.580 --> 27:19.580
Why are you spacing out?

458
27:21.400 --> 27:22.600
I'm not.

459
27:25.840 --> 27:28.600
I've already cancelled my meeting with the client today.

460
27:28.960 --> 27:29.840
I don't think...

461
27:30.020 --> 27:32.240
I'll get everything done in time.

462
27:32.560 --> 27:33.200
What?

463
27:33.840 --> 27:34.760
Why?

464
27:34.780 --> 27:36.320
Do you have something to do today?

465
27:37.440 --> 27:38.320
Well, it's you.

466
27:38.920 --> 27:40.040
You're such a troublemaker.

467
27:41.480 --> 27:42.320
I...

468
27:42.360 --> 27:43.640
ordered some congee.

469
27:43.920 --> 27:45.640
Do you want some? I'll heat it up for you.

470
27:46.000 --> 27:48.040
What, aren't you gonna eat with me?

471
27:49.920 --> 27:51.960
I...already ate

472
27:52.480 --> 27:53.800
before you came down.

473
27:54.800 --> 27:55.960
Well, last night

474
27:56.220 --> 27:57.360
we went to sleep at the same time,

475
27:58.080 --> 27:59.400
so we have to wake up together,

476
27:59.600 --> 28:01.000
and then have

477
28:01.140 --> 28:03.740
breakfast together, like...

478
28:03.760 --> 28:04.440
Stop it!

479
28:04.800 --> 28:05.900
Don't you say it.

480
28:12.080 --> 28:13.080
Go sit and wait for me.

481
28:14.800 --> 28:15.480
Go.

482
28:18.540 --> 28:19.720
Okay.

483
28:38.640 --> 28:40.040
Come sit with me.

484
28:40.400 --> 28:43.000
I told you I already had breakfast.

485
28:44.400 --> 28:46.060
I'm not asking you to eat.

486
28:46.240 --> 28:48.240
I just want you to sit with me.

487
28:50.680 --> 28:51.960
Please?

488
29:15.600 --> 29:16.920
Come on, hurry up and eat,

489
29:17.020 --> 29:18.000
so you can take your meds.

490
29:18.320 --> 29:20.000
Then I can finally go home.

491
29:20.980 --> 29:21.620
What?

492
29:21.920 --> 29:23.880
Didn't you say you'd already rescheduled the client's meeting?

493
29:24.800 --> 29:26.220
Just because I rescheduled it

494
29:26.240 --> 29:28.280
doesn't mean I don't have to go home, you know.

495
29:29.840 --> 29:32.240
But you're the one who told me that

496
29:32.480 --> 29:34.940
a sick person shouldn't be left alone.

497
29:37.680 --> 29:39.520
But you seem better now.

498
29:46.600 --> 29:48.260
Just because I'm feeling better

499
29:48.280 --> 29:50.240
doesn't mean I'm fully recovered.

500
29:50.620 --> 29:52.680
With you here last night,

501
29:52.840 --> 29:54.360
I went to bed early

502
29:54.520 --> 29:56.760
and got a full eight hours of sleep.

503
29:58.280 --> 29:59.280
Good for you.

504
29:59.880 --> 30:01.040
Well...

505
30:01.340 --> 30:03.080
why don't we share a bed every night?

506
30:13.720 --> 30:15.620
Are you gonna leave a sick person alone like this?

507
30:15.640 --> 30:18.100
What if I fall and hit my head on the floor?

508
30:18.120 --> 30:19.720
Aren't you even worried about me?

509
30:20.840 --> 30:22.680
I'm just going back to grab some clothes

510
30:22.700 --> 30:24.320
and a few things real quick.

511
30:24.680 --> 30:26.180
If you can't be on your own,

512
30:26.200 --> 30:27.280
there's nothing I can do.

513
30:27.680 --> 30:29.800
So, that means you'll be back, right?

514
30:31.000 --> 30:33.040
I'll try to be back before noon, then.

515
30:33.400 --> 30:35.240
Let me know if you want anything to eat.

516
30:35.260 --> 30:36.640
I'll grab it on my way back.

517
30:39.000 --> 30:40.560
I want to eat...

518
30:41.960 --> 30:43.400
Anything is fine,

519
30:43.640 --> 30:46.320
as long as I get to eat with you.

520
31:10.680 --> 31:12.440
[Topknot Kuman]

521
31:16.720 --> 31:17.760
Are you here already?

522
31:21.480 --> 31:22.560
- Hi! - Hi!

523
31:26.200 --> 31:28.040
"Mim, Oyl, come on in."

524
31:28.060 --> 31:29.100
Alright, Soul.

525
31:29.120 --> 31:30.800
Gosh, I'm starving.

526
31:36.440 --> 31:38.040
Xinxin, come on in.

527
31:39.600 --> 31:41.620
I haven't seen you in a while, Ms. Xinxin...

528
31:41.640 --> 31:43.280
You look even cuter.

529
31:46.160 --> 31:47.560
- Wow... - Right.

530
31:51.520 --> 31:52.240
Well,

531
31:52.840 --> 31:54.400
I'm glad you can...

532
31:54.720 --> 31:56.520
still remember my name.

533
31:57.560 --> 31:58.660
Of course,

534
31:58.680 --> 31:59.580
Mr. Boy.

535
32:01.880 --> 32:02.600
Uh...

536
32:03.480 --> 32:04.320
It's "Oyl,"

537
32:04.600 --> 32:05.440
not "Boy."

538
32:05.560 --> 32:06.320
Oh...

539
32:07.100 --> 32:08.920
I'm sorry, Mr. Oyl.

540
32:09.400 --> 32:10.500
Well, I...

541
32:10.520 --> 32:13.080
have trouble remembering people's names.

542
32:14.960 --> 32:16.120
It's okay.

543
32:16.200 --> 32:17.180
No wonder

544
32:17.200 --> 32:18.040
you keep...

545
32:18.400 --> 32:20.380
calling Soul

546
32:20.400 --> 32:21.680
"Miss Architect."

547
32:22.060 --> 32:23.240
So that's why.

548
32:24.360 --> 32:25.000
Hey.

549
32:25.500 --> 32:26.680
Don't you have anything better to do today?

550
32:26.740 --> 32:27.960
Got plenty of free time, Soul.

551
32:28.080 --> 32:29.600
Like, I'm free all day.

552
32:29.760 --> 32:30.920
I'll assign you some work, then,

553
32:31.000 --> 32:32.760
- What? - to keep you busy.

554
32:33.040 --> 32:34.560
Come on, Soul.

555
32:34.700 --> 32:35.900
You should be touched

556
32:35.920 --> 32:38.000
that we came all this way to visit you.

557
32:38.680 --> 32:39.320
Hey...

558
32:39.960 --> 32:42.000
if you already have someone to look after you,

559
32:42.020 --> 32:43.440
I think I should head back for now.

560
32:43.840 --> 32:44.520
Hey...

561
32:48.400 --> 32:49.200
Uh...

562
32:49.560 --> 32:51.600
Oyl and I are heading back now, Ms. Xinxin.

563
32:51.720 --> 32:52.320
Huh?

564
32:52.520 --> 32:55.340
We were just passing by, so we thought we'd stop by and check on Soul.

565
32:56.400 --> 32:57.900
- Come on, Oyl. Let's head back. - Huh?!

566
32:57.920 --> 32:59.860
Hey, I still wanna stay.

567
32:59.880 --> 33:01.080
I haven't seen Ms. Xinxin in so long.

568
33:01.280 --> 33:03.260
There's still a ton of work to do, and you're just chilling.

569
33:03.280 --> 33:05.120
Should I have the boss call you in?

570
33:05.140 --> 33:05.840
Come on.

571
33:05.980 --> 33:06.960
- Hey. - Get up!

572
33:07.240 --> 33:08.620
We'll get going now, Soul.

573
33:08.640 --> 33:11.140
Please take care of her too, Ms. Xinxin.

574
33:11.160 --> 33:12.580
Come on, let's go!

575
33:12.600 --> 33:15.080
See you later, Ms. Xinxin. See you!

576
33:15.100 --> 33:16.700
See you, Mr. Boy.

577
33:16.720 --> 33:18.460
- It's Oyl. Oyl. - Right, Mr. Oyl.

578
33:18.480 --> 33:19.680
Yes, Mr. Oyl.

579
33:21.040 --> 33:22.520
I'll leave him to you, Mim.

580
33:27.640 --> 33:29.180
You're not coughing anymore?

581
33:30.080 --> 33:30.860
Coughing...

582
33:30.880 --> 33:31.440
Oh.

583
33:35.160 --> 33:35.800
Ugh...

584
33:52.200 --> 33:53.360
Miss Architect.

585
33:54.280 --> 33:54.920
Hm?

586
33:55.960 --> 33:58.540
Stop working and just get some rest already.

587
33:58.560 --> 34:00.360
I'll wake you up in the evening.

588
34:02.640 --> 34:03.960
Just a little bit more.

589
34:04.480 --> 34:05.640
Please?

590
34:07.080 --> 34:09.240
You said you were gonna be good, didn't you?

591
34:18.480 --> 34:19.740
What is it?

592
34:21.440 --> 34:22.960
You told me to get some rest,

593
34:23.400 --> 34:24.360
so I'm gonna rest.

594
34:25.720 --> 34:26.840
Where?

595
34:28.360 --> 34:29.400
Right here.

596
34:31.640 --> 34:34.000
I meant you should go rest in your room.

597
34:34.080 --> 34:36.080
Can I sleep here, please?

598
34:36.360 --> 34:37.840
Just for a little while.

599
35:21.580 --> 35:23.200
When did I fall asleep?

600
35:24.640 --> 35:25.800
Are you up?

601
35:27.320 --> 35:28.920
Was I being too loud?

602
35:40.520 --> 35:42.720
The last thing I remember,

603
35:43.200 --> 35:44.480
you were the one asleep.

604
35:45.040 --> 35:47.160
Then why did I

605
35:47.280 --> 35:48.720
end up being the one awake?

606
35:49.720 --> 35:51.260
When I woke up,

607
35:51.280 --> 35:54.360
I saw you sleeping with your head drooping like a rag doll.

608
35:54.840 --> 35:56.600
So, I just let you sleep.

609
35:57.120 --> 35:58.720
Stop exaggerating.

610
35:59.000 --> 36:01.280
Oh? You don't believe me, huh?

611
36:04.480 --> 36:05.130
What?

612
36:05.430 --> 36:05.980
Hey.

613
36:06.240 --> 36:07.030
I looked ugly.

614
36:07.590 --> 36:08.360
Come on, delete it!

615
36:08.670 --> 36:09.550
Delete it!

616
36:10.090 --> 36:11.020
But you were cute in this.

617
36:11.580 --> 36:13.140
Hey, delete it!

618
36:15.440 --> 36:16.700
Alright, alright.

619
36:16.720 --> 36:18.120
I'll delete it for you.

620
36:18.520 --> 36:20.760
But I'm hungry now,

621
36:21.360 --> 36:22.760
so let's eat something first.

622
36:35.240 --> 36:37.400
I'm getting tired of congee and rice soup.

623
36:38.200 --> 36:39.280
Can you eat these?

624
36:41.840 --> 36:42.760
Mm.

625
36:44.860 --> 36:46.560
It's been a week, you know.

626
36:49.400 --> 36:50.360
What?

627
36:51.920 --> 36:53.800
We haven't eaten together like this

628
36:54.120 --> 36:56.480
since that day at the restaurant.

629
36:59.240 --> 37:01.900
Well, who has the time for that?

630
37:04.360 --> 37:06.680
Then, how about we

631
37:07.080 --> 37:08.360
go out for a meal this Sunday?

632
37:11.000 --> 37:13.200
But they won't be around this Sunday.

633
37:13.400 --> 37:15.120
Auntie Tai and my mom won't be back by then.

634
37:16.760 --> 37:18.520
This isn't about them.

635
37:18.880 --> 37:21.160
I meant just you and me.

636
37:21.480 --> 37:23.120
Let's have a meal, just the two of us.

637
37:25.120 --> 37:27.080
Just the two of us?

638
37:27.460 --> 37:28.240
Mm.

639
37:29.300 --> 37:30.160
Wanna go with me?

640
37:33.000 --> 37:34.200
Miss Architect.

641
37:36.800 --> 37:37.680
Yes?

642
37:40.060 --> 37:41.440
What you're doing right now...

643
37:42.200 --> 37:43.880
are you trying to hit on me?

644
37:49.540 --> 37:51.560
If I hit on you,

645
37:52.080 --> 37:53.440
would you be okay with that?

646
37:55.960 --> 37:59.720
Since you brought it up, I...

647
37:59.960 --> 38:02.240
Eat it. Eat all of it.

648
38:45.020 --> 38:46.400
You couldn't sleep?

649
38:47.620 --> 38:48.720
Mm...

650
38:49.260 --> 38:51.640
Probably because I took a nap this evening.

651
38:53.300 --> 38:55.140
Did I wake you up?

652
39:05.220 --> 39:06.640
What do you usually do

653
39:06.900 --> 39:08.720
when you can't sleep?

654
39:13.140 --> 39:14.240
Maybe watch a movie.

655
39:14.820 --> 39:16.160
You like watching movies?

656
39:17.300 --> 39:18.100
Mm...

657
39:20.340 --> 39:21.870
What kind do you like?

658
39:22.500 --> 39:23.390
Romance?

659
39:24.100 --> 39:25.470
Or horror?

660
39:26.740 --> 39:28.110
I'm scared of ghosts.

661
39:29.380 --> 39:30.190
Hm?

662
39:32.260 --> 39:34.910
So you're into romance movies.

663
39:38.340 --> 39:39.310
What about you?

664
39:41.780 --> 39:42.760
Mm...

665
39:44.020 --> 39:45.790
I'm not really a movie person,

666
39:46.580 --> 39:48.510
especially at the cinema.

667
39:49.060 --> 39:51.670
The last one I saw was probably...

668
39:53.300 --> 39:54.910
ten years ago, I think.

669
39:57.760 --> 39:59.450
I bet you watched it with your ex.

670
40:02.560 --> 40:04.880
What's with Thai people and their exes?

671
40:07.700 --> 40:08.720
I know, right?

672
40:11.580 --> 40:13.360
Well, I did go see it with my ex,

673
40:13.380 --> 40:15.840
but it was a long time ago.

674
40:15.860 --> 40:17.390
I don't remember much now.

675
40:19.700 --> 40:20.830
So...

676
40:21.900 --> 40:24.400
have you been single ever since?

677
40:26.140 --> 40:28.960
How come you've been single for so long?

678
40:31.900 --> 40:34.750
Well...I'm in no rush.

679
40:36.540 --> 40:37.680
What about you, Xinxin?

680
40:38.340 --> 40:40.760
Auntie Phing told me that...

681
40:40.780 --> 40:42.600
you've never dated anyone.

682
40:42.940 --> 40:44.520
Don't you ever want to be in love?

683
40:46.900 --> 40:48.040
Of course I do.

684
40:49.500 --> 40:51.750
Everyone wants to be in love.

685
40:53.340 --> 40:55.550
I think it'd be nice...

686
40:56.100 --> 40:57.960
to be loved,

687
40:58.740 --> 41:00.080
or to love someone.

688
41:01.940 --> 41:03.840
But I'm not in a rush.

689
41:04.740 --> 41:06.800
I'm only 25.

690
41:09.820 --> 41:11.710
I'm only 29 myself.

691
41:12.180 --> 41:14.400
But my mom...wow,

692
41:14.480 --> 41:16.080
she's really eager for me to find someone.

693
41:16.340 --> 41:17.280
It's like

694
41:18.100 --> 41:19.140
I'm going to die

695
41:19.160 --> 41:20.500
as soon as I turn 30.

696
41:24.800 --> 41:25.960
But...

697
41:26.620 --> 41:28.840
I believe in timing, though.

698
41:29.700 --> 41:30.900
If you're meant

699
41:31.300 --> 41:32.760
to find someone,

700
41:33.320 --> 41:35.040
it'll happen eventually.

701
41:41.740 --> 41:43.390
Then why did you buy me that lamp?

702
41:47.560 --> 41:48.310
Well...

703
41:49.460 --> 41:52.240
it's meant to ward off bad luck.

704
41:53.620 --> 41:55.360
And why did you believe me?

705
41:57.200 --> 41:58.920
I didn't believe you.

706
41:59.780 --> 42:01.920
I just didn't want to upset you.

707
42:06.800 --> 42:08.600
You're actually pretty nice, huh?

708
42:10.340 --> 42:12.040
You just realized that?

709
42:19.200 --> 42:20.280
Uh...

710
42:21.880 --> 42:23.800
Can I ask you something?

711
42:25.780 --> 42:26.680
Hm?

712
42:29.860 --> 42:30.960
Let's say...

713
42:31.100 --> 42:32.000
Like...

714
42:32.820 --> 42:34.920
Let's say...

715
42:35.480 --> 42:37.160
when we really like someone,

716
42:39.000 --> 42:40.650
what does it feel like?

717
42:41.100 --> 42:43.080
Like, I mean...

718
42:43.940 --> 42:45.880
How would we know?

719
42:49.500 --> 42:51.320
Just listen to your heart.

720
42:54.340 --> 42:55.380
How so?

721
43:02.880 --> 43:04.560
Come on, get up.

722
43:10.820 --> 43:13.360
Try placing your hand on your heart, like this.

723
43:19.200 --> 43:20.240
Do you feel anything?

724
43:21.920 --> 43:22.920
It's beating.

725
43:24.240 --> 43:26.560
Well, of course it's beating.

726
43:30.200 --> 43:31.240
What do you feel?

727
43:38.860 --> 43:39.980
I...

728
43:40.540 --> 43:41.600
feel...

729
43:44.820 --> 43:46.520
Feel what?

730
43:51.220 --> 43:52.600
My heart is racing.

731
44:00.660 --> 44:01.880
Just like that.

732
44:07.860 --> 44:09.720
If you like someone,

733
44:10.520 --> 44:12.360
your heart will race

734
44:12.740 --> 44:14.360
when you're near them.

735
44:55.540 --> 44:57.120
Sweet dreams, Xinxin.

736
45:15.420 --> 45:17.680
I think I really like Xinxin.

737
45:17.740 --> 45:19.160
She finally admitted it.

738
45:20.240 --> 45:21.160
You knew?

739
45:21.440 --> 45:22.500
Gosh, Soul.

740
45:22.520 --> 45:24.040
It's this obvious.

741
45:24.060 --> 45:25.240
So, what's next?

742
45:25.440 --> 45:26.620
Have you told her you like her?

743
45:26.640 --> 45:27.880
- Yeah. - Yeah?

744
45:30.280 --> 45:31.580
- What? - Gosh...

745
45:31.600 --> 45:32.880
What the heck, Soul?

746
45:33.220 --> 45:35.800
You're nothing like the lady-killer Ms. Xinxin said you were.

747
45:37.160 --> 45:38.361
How can she act like nothing's going on

748
45:38.373 --> 45:40.080
when I'm being this obvious?

749
45:40.420 --> 45:41.940
She didn't respond

750
45:41.960 --> 45:43.640
to anything I said.

751
45:44.460 --> 45:47.120
Well, you haven't told her you like her yet.

752
45:47.580 --> 45:49.680
- Maybe she's not sure yet. - Mm.

753
45:49.840 --> 45:51.300
If you like someone, just tell them.

754
45:51.320 --> 45:53.100
Love isn't that complicated, Soul.

755
45:53.120 --> 45:54.280
- She's right! - Mm.

756
45:56.100 --> 45:58.980
And did Ms. Lada say anything

757
45:59.000 --> 46:00.280
to you about Xinxin, Mim?

758
46:01.120 --> 46:02.520
No, she didn't.

759
46:02.640 --> 46:03.920
Hey, wait, wait, wait.

760
46:04.320 --> 46:05.320
Lada...

761
46:05.340 --> 46:08.380
You mean Ms. Lada, who talks to you about work all the time?

762
46:08.680 --> 46:10.080
Why her?

763
46:10.360 --> 46:11.400
You didn't know?

764
46:12.080 --> 46:12.760
Hey.

765
46:13.360 --> 46:14.220
I didn't.

766
46:14.240 --> 46:15.920
So, what do you guys even know?

767
46:16.260 --> 46:18.800
Hey, how could you not tell me, Soul?!

768
46:19.040 --> 46:20.737
We're partners. We're on the same team.

769
46:20.742 --> 46:21.950
Come on, Soul, tell me.

770
46:21.960 --> 46:23.400
Gosh!

771
46:23.640 --> 46:25.360
Lada and I are dating!

772
46:25.390 --> 46:26.250
- What?! - Period!

773
46:27.720 --> 46:28.880
You?!

774
46:30.080 --> 46:31.960
Gosh, I'm shocked!

775
46:32.460 --> 46:34.180
That Lada and I are dating?

776
46:34.200 --> 46:36.330
No, that I'm the only one still single.

777
46:36.840 --> 46:39.160
- Ugh... - Come on. I'm single, too.

778
46:39.800 --> 46:41.671
If you don't make a move,

779
46:41.683 --> 46:42.800
you'll stay single for sure.

780
46:43.320 --> 46:44.740
Then what do you want me to do?

781
46:44.760 --> 46:47.140
She snuck back home early yesterday morning.

782
46:47.160 --> 46:48.320
I've called and texted her,

783
46:48.340 --> 46:50.360
but she still hasn't replied.

784
46:51.080 --> 46:52.900
So, what did you do to her?

785
46:52.920 --> 46:53.540
Yeah.

786
46:53.560 --> 46:55.120
Don't tell me...

787
46:56.740 --> 46:58.240
I didn't do anything.

788
46:58.460 --> 47:00.100
Well, I just...

789
47:00.120 --> 47:01.370
- Just? - Just?

790
47:02.640 --> 47:04.020
I just asked her

791
47:04.040 --> 47:06.680
if she'd be okay with me hitting on her.

792
47:07.880 --> 47:10.260
- Gosh, I'm swooning. - Ow, that hurts!

793
47:10.280 --> 47:11.610
Oh, I'm sorry.

794
47:12.680 --> 47:14.240
But she didn't respond.

795
47:14.340 --> 47:16.240
She didn't say yes, but she didn't say no either.

796
47:16.300 --> 47:18.820
- That means you still have a chance. - Mm, true.

797
47:18.840 --> 47:19.738
Then go.

798
47:19.750 --> 47:21.280
- Get off work right now. - Go, go, go.

799
47:21.300 --> 47:22.220
Go where?

800
47:22.240 --> 47:25.060
- Gosh, Soul. - Go see Xinxin!

801
47:25.080 --> 47:26.120
- Yeah. - Go!

802
47:26.140 --> 47:28.360
Been smart for half the series, then suddenly gone so dumb?!

803
47:31.020 --> 47:32.020
Hurry.

804
47:32.040 --> 47:34.154
Alright, here's your bag.

805
47:34.166 --> 47:35.200
Go on, open the door.

806
47:35.640 --> 47:36.380
Off you go!

807
47:42.740 --> 47:43.640
Finally.

808
47:43.740 --> 47:44.760
Took her so long to admit it.

809
47:49.460 --> 47:50.800
"So, can I?"

810
47:51.200 --> 47:52.700
If you weren't that important,

811
47:52.720 --> 47:54.700
she wouldn't leave her meeting just to see you.

812
47:54.710 --> 47:55.430
Am I right?

813
47:56.520 --> 48:00.290
You're not the only architect in this world, you know.

814
48:02.240 --> 48:04.780
But the only feng shui master I want to work with

815
48:06.280 --> 48:07.560
is you, Xinxin.

816
48:11.120 --> 48:13.520
I meant you should go rest in your room.

817
48:13.800 --> 48:15.560
Can I sleep here, please?

818
48:15.880 --> 48:17.280
Just for a little while.

819
48:20.980 --> 48:23.600
Try placing your hand on your heart, like this.

820
48:28.800 --> 48:29.850
I...

821
48:30.500 --> 48:31.640
feel...

822
48:33.840 --> 48:35.320
Oh my gosh!

823
48:35.400 --> 48:37.520
Who's there?

824
49:00.280 --> 49:01.160
What?

825
49:01.600 --> 49:02.760
So you're home, huh?

826
49:04.120 --> 49:06.760
Why didn't you call first before coming over?

827
49:08.060 --> 49:09.760
And you answered my calls?

828
49:13.320 --> 49:15.080
I bought a lot of food,

829
49:15.600 --> 49:16.880
but I can't finish it all by myself.

830
49:17.720 --> 49:18.760
Have some with me.

831
49:21.520 --> 49:22.500
Please?

832
49:39.760 --> 49:41.080
Were you avoiding me on purpose?

833
49:42.800 --> 49:43.880
No, I wasn't.

834
49:44.440 --> 49:46.880
It's not like I was avoiding you.

835
49:47.840 --> 49:49.020
Xinxin, you're a terrible liar,

836
49:49.040 --> 49:50.600
you know that?

837
49:51.480 --> 49:52.320
And...

838
49:52.920 --> 49:54.880
how did you know I was lying?

839
49:55.880 --> 49:57.420
Whenever you lie,

840
49:57.440 --> 49:58.560
your nose flares.

841
50:02.080 --> 50:02.880
Really?

842
50:04.040 --> 50:04.880
See?

843
50:04.900 --> 50:06.440
You really lied to me.

844
50:11.000 --> 50:11.920
So?

845
50:12.400 --> 50:13.400
Tell me.

846
50:14.720 --> 50:16.480
Why were you avoiding me?

847
50:16.750 --> 50:18.080
Don't talk to me like that.

848
50:18.400 --> 50:21.000
And don't make that kind of face, either.

849
50:23.120 --> 50:24.280
Okay.

850
50:25.200 --> 50:25.920
Alright.

851
50:26.160 --> 50:27.680
Can you tell me what's wrong yet?

852
50:28.920 --> 50:30.640
I wasn't avoiding you.

853
50:31.040 --> 50:32.440
I just needed to collect myself.

854
50:34.080 --> 50:35.380
- Why did you... - Stop!

855
50:35.400 --> 50:36.320
Stop right there.

856
50:36.660 --> 50:38.960
No more questions allowed.

857
50:41.280 --> 50:43.160
You're acting like a celebrity.

858
50:49.200 --> 50:50.960
Okay, no more teasing. Eat up.

859
51:04.320 --> 51:06.920
Hurry up so you can go home.

860
51:08.480 --> 51:09.640
When you put it like that,

861
51:09.840 --> 51:11.440
you really want me to leave, don't you?

862
51:16.880 --> 51:19.060
I just checked the forecast.

863
51:19.080 --> 51:20.560
It's going to rain heavily tonight.

864
51:21.080 --> 51:22.720
I don't want you to be alone.

865
51:23.480 --> 51:25.000
I can be on my own.

866
51:25.320 --> 51:28.040
It's not the first time I've been alone when it rains.

867
51:33.000 --> 51:34.120
But now

868
51:35.120 --> 51:36.560
you have me.

869
51:41.400 --> 51:42.040
Hm?

870
51:45.880 --> 51:46.920
Then...

871
51:47.920 --> 51:49.010
suit yourself.

872
52:15.600 --> 52:17.280
"Don't lock the door tonight, okay?"

873
52:17.960 --> 52:19.720
But I always lock my room.

874
52:21.740 --> 52:23.320
Just for tonight.

875
52:23.920 --> 52:25.080
So if it rains,

876
52:26.180 --> 52:27.880
I'll be there with you.

877
53:28.400 --> 53:29.360
Xinxin.

878
53:43.720 --> 53:44.520
Xinxin.

879
54:08.080 --> 54:08.960
Xinxin...

880
54:10.120 --> 54:11.160
Xinxin...

881
54:12.060 --> 54:13.360
Look at me, Xinxin.

882
54:18.720 --> 54:19.960
Soul...

883
54:27.660 --> 54:28.840
It's alright.

884
54:31.160 --> 54:32.340
Don't be scared, okay?

885
54:34.120 --> 54:35.440
I'm right here.

886
54:49.080 --> 54:50.560
Don't be scared.

887
54:52.000 --> 54:53.480
I'm right here.

888
54:57.560 --> 54:59.140
Xinxin, do you remember

889
54:59.760 --> 55:01.600
what I once told you?

890
55:02.780 --> 55:04.040
One day,

891
55:04.920 --> 55:06.760
you'll find your own umbrella.

892
55:09.000 --> 55:10.260
I do.

893
55:13.760 --> 55:15.560
Can I be...

894
55:17.600 --> 55:19.500
that umbrella of yours?

895
55:22.320 --> 55:24.560
Can I be your safe place,

896
55:25.540 --> 55:26.540
please?

897
55:27.760 --> 55:29.200
Soul...

898
55:37.180 --> 55:38.520
Your heart is

899
55:39.200 --> 55:40.680
beating really fast, you know.

900
55:50.960 --> 55:53.000
You still haven't told me

901
55:55.120 --> 55:55.980
if I can.

902
56:03.360 --> 56:04.600
Or...

903
56:05.760 --> 56:07.160
do you find me off-putting?

904
56:07.820 --> 56:09.440
I don't find you off-putting.

905
56:13.000 --> 56:15.420
You don't find me off-putting.

906
56:16.960 --> 56:18.560
Then that means...

907
56:20.640 --> 56:21.520
you like me.

908
56:23.640 --> 56:25.240
Well, I...

909
56:30.680 --> 56:31.880
I'm not gonna say it.

910
56:38.160 --> 56:39.280
If you won't say it,

911
56:40.600 --> 56:41.760
that's fine.

912
56:42.880 --> 56:44.600
But I'll take that as...

913
56:46.440 --> 56:47.860
you

914
56:50.320 --> 56:52.240
liking me.

915
57:07.440 --> 57:09.120
May I?

916
58:06.440 --> 58:07.400
Sweet dreams.

917
58:16.160 --> 58:16.840
- Oh! - Oh!

918
58:16.920 --> 58:17.640
- My! - My!

919
58:17.740 --> 58:20.140
- God! - God!

920
58:20.160 --> 58:21.320
Are you two together?

921
58:21.480 --> 58:23.540
Whatever makes you happy,

922
58:23.560 --> 58:24.520
I'll do it.

923
58:25.840 --> 58:27.960
How will things be between us from now on?

924
58:28.440 --> 58:30.180
Things will be

925
58:30.200 --> 58:31.880
a lot clearer between us.

926
58:33.640 --> 58:35.200
When are you gonna stop running away?

927
58:39.440 --> 58:41.900
It shouldn't be aligned with the back door.

928
58:42.560 --> 58:43.440
Mm...

929
58:44.040 --> 58:45.520
For the second floor...

930
58:45.920 --> 58:47.720
let's add a few more windows

931
58:48.240 --> 58:50.120
to let positive energy into the house.

932
58:51.600 --> 58:52.680
Okay.

933
58:54.640 --> 58:55.680
Are you writing that down?

934
58:56.600 --> 58:57.240
Hm?

935
58:57.540 --> 58:58.560
I am.

936
58:59.200 --> 59:00.320
On my hand?

937
59:03.920 --> 59:05.640
You're not even paying attention.

938
59:06.020 --> 59:08.400
I'm gonna tell Madam Waen to cut your budget.

939
59:09.320 --> 59:10.000
Ouch!

940
59:10.480 --> 59:11.680
Soul!

941
59:12.340 --> 59:13.840
That hurts!

942
59:14.740 --> 59:15.840
Call me that again.

943
59:16.500 --> 59:17.400
Call you what?

944
59:18.660 --> 59:19.760
"Soul."

945
59:25.880 --> 59:27.040
You'll have to wait.

946
59:27.580 --> 59:28.920
I'll call you that

947
59:28.930 --> 59:31.280
once I truly trust you.

948
59:34.380 --> 59:35.520
I'll be waiting.

949
59:43.200 --> 59:44.720
For the third floor,

950
59:45.120 --> 59:46.300
let's add more lighting.

951
59:46.320 --> 59:48.000
Add more lighting on the third floor.

952
59:48.020 --> 59:49.040
How many?

953
59:49.700 --> 59:51.280
Well, not 20.

954
59:52.640 --> 59:55.440
- Not 20... - Soul!
